WEBVTT

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:38.600
The Greek Sanctuary.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:41.980
Cradle to the Saints of Athena,

00:01:41.980 --> 00:01:47.060
protectors of Earth's peace and justice,
since the age of myths.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:51.540
The Saints, each protected by one of
the 88 Guardian Constellations.

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:54.390
The Sanctuary also houses the Pope's inner circle.

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:59.380
And at its center, the twelve zodiac signs
oversee the Gold Saints.

00:01:59.380 --> 00:02:04.070
And beyond the Pope's Chambers,
in the Chamber of Athena,

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.280
Athena herself, descended to Earth,

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:09.090
watches over the Sanctuary.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:33.630
Cadets sparring is always a sight to behold.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:38.000
But of all this number,
only a handful can become Saints.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.140
So you're the new guy, Tenma?

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.870
Wanna fight me?

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:53.640
Huh?

00:02:53.640 --> 00:02:54.940
Don't do it!

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:58.420
This kid was brought in by Libra Dohko personally,

00:02:58.420 --> 00:03:02.950
and he attained a Cosmo by himself.
He's no normal cadet!

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.320
Even you, Yato...

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.920
Don't make me laugh. Who do you think I am?

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:12.790
I, Yato, am the closest here to becoming a Saint.

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:14.540
He can't beat me!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.800
I've heard of you, Yato.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:26.850
That so?

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:29.810
That you're a clumsy bully...

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:32.270
So they were talking about you.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.730
Well, I can't point fingers.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:39.820
Nice to meet you!

00:03:47.410 --> 00:03:48.580
Back off!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.250
Let's go.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.550
You!

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.450
What?

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:30.010
I thought you'd be a challenge, but...

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.290
Is that all you've got?

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:37.630
You think you can be a Saint of Athena like that?

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.590
It's not that easy!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.310
You...

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:02.280
Do yourself a favor and go back home!

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.500
I think Dohko made a mistake with you.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.360
Crap!

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:10.950
Putting me down that way!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:23.920
Not looking so good, Tenma!

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:27.970
Dohko! You're back!

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:31.510
I just finished my recon mission.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:35.430
By the way, you've been here a few months,

00:05:35.430 --> 00:05:37.640
but you still can't break a rock like this?

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:39.900
Of course I can break this rock!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.230
You saw me, didn't you?

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:44.860
On that stormy day...

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:49.870
I could do it then. Why can't I do it now?

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:54.580
It's because you still fail to
understand the root of destruction.

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:56.790
The root of destruction?

00:05:57.300 --> 00:05:58.360
Yes.

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.800
First, it is best to understand that everything

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.250
in this world is composed of atoms.

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.300
Everything in this universe was created

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:17.030
by the Big Bang and is constructed of atoms.

00:06:17.680 --> 00:06:22.290
As Saints, we strengthen the
universe inside ourselves,

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.610
the Cosmo, causing it to explode.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.990
In other words,

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.900
we split atoms.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:36.090
On that day, you were focused
on saving your friends,

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:40.400
and you subconsciously strengthened
your Cosmo to its utmost power,

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.040
to crush the giant rock.

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:44.950
Focus your energy on the point

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:48.900
you wish to destroy,
just as you did on that day.

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.650
You promised to return home
as a Saint, didn't you?

00:07:04.110 --> 00:07:09.360
Fortunately, I'll be here at
the Sanctuary for a while.

00:07:09.890 --> 00:07:14.830
I'm looking forward to pushing you every day!

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:23.330
Damn it! My promise to my friends?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.460
I know, already!

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:28.340
<i>Alone...</i>

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:33.650
<i>Right now, he's probably painting lots of pictures.</i>

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.960
I'm going to do this!

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.510
<i>Alone?</i>

00:07:52.900 --> 00:07:54.280
<i>I thought so!</i>

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:56.490
Wait!

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.080
<i>What?</i>

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:00.880
<i>A girl?</i>

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:14.260
S-Sasha?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:16.760
How do you know my name?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.440
I knew it!

00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:20.470
It's me! Tenma!

00:08:21.460 --> 00:08:22.720
Tenma?

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:27.610
You, Alone, and I were at the
same orphanage together!

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:31.320
You were adopted, so I didn't know
you'd be here at the Sanctuary.

00:08:31.320 --> 00:08:34.060
Well, I guess you were too young to remember.

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:36.530
See! The flower bracelet you made.

00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:41.290
Tenma... Really?

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:45.000
I remember.

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.570
Here you go!

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.290
How could I forget?

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:57.270
My kind friend Alone and tough Tenma...

00:08:57.270 --> 00:08:59.430
I never forgot about you,
not once since coming here.

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.400
Oh, yeah. Sasha...

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:02.050
Yes?

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.900
Why are you here?

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:06.270
If Alone knew, he'd be so surprised.

00:09:09.370 --> 00:09:12.960
Did you come here to become a Saint?

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:17.750
Yeah! I promised Alone that I'd become a Saint.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.420
What are you doing here at the Sanctuary?

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:25.210
I...

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:29.920
Sasha!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:30.710
Move!

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:41.180
Tenma!

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.400
Well, aren't you a couple of lively kittens?

00:09:55.400 --> 00:09:57.180
I think I can have some fun with you.

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:01.740
I just found some good
little toys to amuse myself with...

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:04.410
Before I take care of Athena!

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:06.750
Crap!

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.220
Who the hell are you?!

00:10:17.940 --> 00:10:20.640
I'm the Earthly Hiding Star, Worm Raimi!

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:25.000
And I love hearing little girls scream.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:27.670
Stop! Don't touch Sasha!

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:32.770
Whine all you want,
but with your puny strength,

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:36.280
you'll never escape my worms.

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.490
All right then, little girl...

00:10:39.490 --> 00:10:42.870
What will your screams sound like?

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:44.380
<i>No...</i>

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:46.880
<i>I won't be beaten by a creep like him.</i>

00:10:47.890 --> 00:10:49.410
<i>I'm...</i>

00:10:49.890 --> 00:10:52.610
<i>I'm going to be a Saint!</i>

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:55.050
<i>I won't let this thing</i>

00:10:55.050 --> 00:10:57.880
<i>get Alone or Sasha.</i>

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:03.050
I won't let you hurt her!

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.010
What?

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.890
You broke through my worms?

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:17.690
Crap! I missed!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:23.000
What's with this kid?
He's not even a Saint, and he's got a Cosmo.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.030
Take that!

00:11:27.180 --> 00:11:29.290
<i>Worm's Bind!</i>

00:11:35.280 --> 00:11:40.280
Why did I have to use my
strongest move on this brat?

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:45.220
Don't take me by surprise!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:49.680
You brat! You brat! You stupid brat!

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:50.980
Stop!

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:56.310
I won't let you hurt him any more!

00:11:57.690 --> 00:11:58.880
Just wait.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:01.320
I'll kill you soon enough, too.

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:04.700
<i>What's this feeling?</i>

00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:06.960
<i>A Cosmo.</i>

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:11.670
<i>What? What a vast...</i>

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.950
I see. So you're...

00:12:20.950 --> 00:12:23.420
Well, that saves me the trouble of finding you.

00:12:23.420 --> 00:12:25.550
Now I'll really make a name for myself.

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.600
<i>Worm's Bind!</i>

00:12:29.320 --> 00:12:30.620
<i>Sasha...</i>

00:12:30.620 --> 00:12:31.680
<i>Stardust...</i>

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.460
<i>Revolution!</i>

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:55.030
I am Aries Shion. Apologies for my late arrival.

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:59.170
Goddess Athena.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:03.440
<i>S-Sasha is... Athena.</i>

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:22.610
2 Years Later...

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:28.950
It's over.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:39.130
I can't lose here!

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.860
That light...

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.070
Well, well...

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:12.370
Tenma is the winner!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:18.210
Well done, Tenma!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:22.340
I now pronounce you a Saint,
and I endow you with this Cloth.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:48.300
Here, a new Pegasus Saint is born!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:58.490
We've gained information that
Specters now gather in Italy.

00:14:59.170 --> 00:15:02.000
The situation is extremely severe.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.320
Tenma, as a new Saint,

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:08.340
prepare yourself to battle
Underworld troops soon.

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:13.600
For the Earth's safety, sacrifice yourself
completely to protect Athena!

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:26.330
Lady Athena...

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:28.230
No way!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:31.780
<i>I've finally become a Saint.</i>

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:34.400
<i>What are you doing, Alone?</i>

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:44.130
<i>Every day, I'm painting...</i>

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.190
<i>Just like I promised you.</i>

00:15:47.890 --> 00:15:50.090
<i>But Tenma...</i>

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.850
<i>The world looks gray.</i>

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.310
<i>The life has left my paintings.</i>

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:05.100
<i>Everything I paint...</i>

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.300
<i>perishes!</i>

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:19.830
Poor boy.

00:16:21.450 --> 00:16:25.670
That you should shake with guilt,
when your heart is so pure...

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.790
You...

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.790
From back then...

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:36.670
You paint to save people's souls,

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:39.390
and all your pictures are perfectly beautiful.

00:16:40.150 --> 00:16:41.300
Because...

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:49.520
Ultimately, true salvation lies in death.

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:53.510
Death is salvation...

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.990
But first, you need to be saved.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:00.150
Come.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.450
Let us go.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:02.700
Where?

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.900
To the cathedral in the forest.

00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:11.510
You know that there's a painting
in the cathedral that would cause

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:14.030
even the most hardened criminals
to repent their sins.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:18.890
Your dream is to glimpse that painting.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:21.010
So I shall grant...

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.510
...that wish.

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:33.450
<i>The cathedral...</i>

00:17:36.420 --> 00:17:38.800
<i>The door that's always shut...</i>

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:43.330
I've been waiting for you.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:47.990
<i>That's the man who came to look
at my painting in the church.</i>

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:53.250
Please come in.

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:06.270
<i>The stars are moving quickly.</i>

00:18:13.140 --> 00:18:14.480
Hey, Sasha.

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:17.450
Tenma! How did you get in here?

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:21.860
This is Athena's Chamber.
It's very hard to enter.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.040
I'm not telling.

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:27.690
I have so many things I want to
talk about with you,

00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.120
but you're Athena. So...

00:18:30.740 --> 00:18:34.840
That doesn't mean... You're as crazy as ever.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.420
Do you remember, Tenma...

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:39.710
When we were small?

00:18:39.710 --> 00:18:40.300
Huh?

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.910
I always protected Alone,

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.430
who was too kind-hearted to ever hurt anyone.

00:18:47.380 --> 00:18:50.500
And you looked out for both of us.

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:55.510
You'd always run over to guard us.

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:57.000
Yeah, I did.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:19:03.410
That's why, when you left,
I vowed to protect Alone for you.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:10.250
I heard the Specters are
gathering near our hometown.

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:12.250
Yes.

00:19:12.810 --> 00:19:15.500
Do you think he's... That Alone is...

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.540
safe?

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:25.130
<i>The painting I've been wanting to see
is at this corridor's far end.</i>

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.340
<i>Tenma...</i>

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:43.490
<i>I want to be saved.</i>

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:44.910
<i>I want to see the painting!</i>

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:47.370
<i>And when I do...</i>

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.830
<i>When I do, then...</i>

00:19:59.930 --> 00:20:00.990
<i>Why?</i>

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.690
<i>It looks just like me...</i>

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:12.100
Do not look away, Alone.

00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:19.520
That is the real you, the version
of yourself who is truly saved.

00:20:19.520 --> 00:20:23.740
Look. There are saved people there, too.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:26.830
<i>The place I grew up...</i>

00:20:27.970 --> 00:20:29.290
<i>No...</i>

00:20:29.980 --> 00:20:31.250
<i>It can't be.</i>

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:46.390
Three days ago, did you not paint these children?

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:49.350
You filled the picture with love.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.100
That is why...

00:20:53.160 --> 00:20:54.350
Because I...

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.020
Because I painted them?!

00:21:01.270 --> 00:21:03.780
There is no need to despair.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:07.630
Look at the painting.

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.710
Death is salvation.

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:22.920
It is a peaceful ending, a truly impartial
and complete salvation for all.

00:21:24.650 --> 00:21:27.010
The children are laughing.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:32.300
<i>They will no longer be bullied,</i>

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.490
<i>or go hungry, out of poverty.</i>

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:36.690
<i>They need fear tomorrow no more.</i>

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:40.750
<i>I see. Death is salvation.</i>

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.070
<i>And I...</i>

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:54.040
The moon was innocuous before, but now...

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:56.200
Sasha, what does this mean?

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:01.570
<i>I am...</i>

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:10.010
I am...

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:15.980
King of the Underworld, Hades.

00:22:17.050 --> 00:22:19.560
Hades has awakened.

00:22:19.560 --> 00:22:20.560
What?

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.110
The Holy War has begun!

00:24:03.150 --> 00:24:08.170
Alone, I heard that King Hades is in our hometown.

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:11.490
I'm so worried about you.

00:24:11.490 --> 00:24:16.050
Please, please be safe until I reach you.

00:24:16.620 --> 00:24:21.530
I'll protect you. For Sasha, too.

00:24:23.140 --> 00:24:26.770
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:26.770 --> 00:24:27.980
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.760 --> 00:24:30.240
The Holy War Begins.
